# Cross-origin isolation.
#
# SharedArrayBuffer — which the judge uses to interrupt a testcase that
# outruns its wall-clock deadline — is only exposed to cross-origin isolated
# documents. Without these two headers the constructor is simply undefined and
# judging silently falls back to adjudicating the deadline after each testcase
# has already run to completion.
#
# require-corp blocks cross-origin subresources that do not opt in. This site
# serves Pyodide, the WASM modules and every asset from its own origin, and the
# dev server has run under the identical pair since the Pyodide integration
# landed.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
